* General improvements and bug fixes for a smoother and more reliable app experience.","version":"7.3.0","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"We are Scandinavia!\n\nCheck in from the comfort of your home and get your boarding pass right on your phone — available even when you’re offline.\n\n---\n\nJourneys that matter with Scandinavian Airlines\n\nThe SAS App is your indispensable travel companion — helping you book, manage, and enjoy your trip from start to finish.\n\n---\n\n APP FEATURES\n\nPlan and manage your trip\n• Book flights to destinations worldwide\n• View and manage your bookings anytime\n• Make changes easily and receive real-time flight updates\n• Access all your trip details in one place\n• Track your checked-in baggage\n• Add extras to enhance your journey – from inflight meals and extra bags to lounge access and travel class upgrades\n\n---\n\nEasy check-in\n\n• Check in from 22 hours before departure\n• Get your digital boarding pass instantly and add it to Apple Wallet\n• Choose your preferred seat\n• Save your passport details for faster check-in next time\n\n---\n\nFor EuroBonus members\n\n• Access your digital EuroBonus card directly in the app\n• View your current point balance anytime\n\n---\n\nEntertainment on the go\n\n• From 22 hours before departure, enjoy free access to newspapers, magazines, and books in multiple languages — directly in the app\n\n---\n\nSustainability\n\nWe’re continuously working to make travel more sustainable — from developing innovative technical solutions to implementing small but meaningful improvements in our daily operations.\nLearn more about our sustainability journey at flysas.com\n\n---\n\nThe SAS App — your trusted travel companion for journeys that matter.","minimumOsVersion":"15.0","trackCensoredName":"SAS – Scandinavian Airlines","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/sas-scandinavian-airlines/id605727126?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","bundleId":"sas.se.sascore","averageU